# Line endings.
#
# Git is left to its usual text handling for source and prose, but every
# artifact whose SHA256 is recorded as provenance is pinned to LF. Those
# digests are the whole point of the Phase 3 freeze manifest (§36) and of
# configs/frozen/: if a checkout on a different platform rewrote the bytes,
# the recorded digest would no longer describe the file on disk, and a
# replicator would see a spurious integrity failure.

* text=auto

# Frozen / hashed provenance artifacts — never rewrite these.
configs/phase3/freeze/**   text eol=lf
configs/phase3/*.yaml      text eol=lf
configs/frozen/**          text eol=lf
prompts/*.txt              text eol=lf
*.jsonl                    text eol=lf
